flowchart TD
 Scope[Accepted scope and capability inventory] --> Candidate[Exact candidate and manifest]
 Candidate --> Shared[Policy / data / AI / operations foundation]
 Shared --> Tests[Bound and executed validation]
 Tests --> Dark[Dark deployment / compatible migrations]
 Dark --> Authority[Current professional and customer acceptance]
 Authority --> Cohort[Approved tenant / cohort / operation]
 Cohort --> Observe[Operated monitoring / support / dual run]
 Observe --> Green[Accepted applicable green cells]
 Cohort -->|Incident or withdrawn authority| Hold[Kill / held mode / checkpoint]
 Hold --> Repair[Reconcile / compatible rollback / recovery]
 Repair --> Tests
